UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under IRC Section 11(b) as amended by the TCJA (2017), all C corporations are taxed at a single flat rate of 21% on taxable income, effective for tax years beginning after December 31, 2017. This replaced the prior graduated rate structure.
Wrong (A): The graduated rate structure (15%, 25%, 34%, 35%) was eliminated by the TCJA and replaced with the flat 21% rate for all C corporations.
Wrong (B): A 28% rate is not the current corporate tax rate; it has been proposed in various legislative discussions but is not enacted law.
Wrong (D): A 15% rate was the lowest bracket under the pre-TCJA graduated structure and is not the current flat rate.$EXPL$
