  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under IRC Section 703(b), certain elections affecting the computation of taxable income derived from a partnership are made by the partnership entity. These include the choice of accounting method (cash vs. accrual) and depreciation method.
Wrong (B): Filing status and standard deduction are individual tax attributes determined at the partner level on their personal returns, not at the partnership level.
Wrong (C): Itemized deductions and personal exemptions are individual tax computations made by each partner, not partnership-level elections.
